# Which recording recipe demo/record.sh uses. One of the names in demo/lib/.
#
# vhs        — this piece. The deliverable is a command and two CSV files, so
#              the clip is a terminal: VHS renders text natively instead of
#              photographing it, which is what keeps a table readable at GIF
#              size. See demo/demo.tape.
#
# playwright — the browser recipe, inherited from portfolio piece #2 and still
#              here so piece #4 can choose it without reinventing it. It needs
#              a demo/scene.py, which this piece does not have.
vhs
